<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f4f5;padding:24px 12px;">
    <tr><td align="center">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;">
        <tr><td style="background:#111827;padding:20px 32px;">
          <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr>
            <td style="vertical-align:middle;padding-right:12px;"><img src="https://carboncube-ke.com/logo-mark.png" alt="Carbon Cube" width="40" height="40" style="display:block;border:0;" /></td>
            <td style="vertical-align:middle;"><span style="color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;">Carbon Cube <span style="color:#f59e0b;">Kenya</span></span></td>
          </tr></table>
        </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:32px;color:#1f2937;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Hi <strong><%= @business_name %></strong> team,</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">I'm reaching out from <strong>Carbon Cube Kenya</strong>, a Nairobi marketplace where shops and suppliers like yours list their products and get contacted directly by buyers across Kenya.</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;"><%= @personalization_line %></p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:bold;">What you get:</p>
          <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 20px;">
            <tr><td style="padding:4px 0;vertical-align:top;width:20px;color:#f59e0b;">&#10003;</td><td style="padding:4px 0;"><strong>Free Premium until end of 2026</strong> — every new seller is currently onboarded onto our top tier at no cost, which puts your listings ahead in search</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding:4px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#f59e0b;">&#10003;</td><td style="padding:4px 0;"><strong>We do the setup for you</strong> — send us your catalog or price list (WhatsApp, email, whatever you have) and our team uploads your products or services. No typing, no paperwork</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding:4px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#f59e0b;">&#10003;</td><td style="padding:4px 0;"><strong>Buyers contact you directly</strong> — by call or WhatsApp, and we take no commission on your sales</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding:4px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#f59e0b;">&#10003;</td><td style="padding:4px 0;"><strong>A verified badge</strong> — our field team visits your shop once, which builds trust and lifts your listings</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding:4px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#f59e0b;">&#10003;</td><td style="padding:4px 0;"><strong>Visibility beyond walk-ins</strong> — your products show up to buyers searching online, not just passing by</td></tr>
          </table>
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The easiest way in: reply to this email or WhatsApp your catalog to <a href="https://wa.me/254727854903" style="color:#111827;">+254&nbsp;727&nbsp;854&nbsp;903</a> — we'll handle the rest. Prefer to talk? Call us on <a href="tel:+254712990524" style="color:#111827;">+254&nbsp;712&nbsp;990&nbsp;524</a>.</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">We're also on mobile — download the <a href="<%= @play_store_url %>" style="color:#111827;font-weight:bold;">Carbon Cube app on Google Play</a> to manage your shop and chat with buyers on the go.</p>
          <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 8px;">
            <tr><td style="background:#f59e0b;border-radius:999px;">
              <a href="https://carboncube-ke.com/onboarding/seller" style="display:inline-block;padding:11px 16px;color:#111827;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;">Sign up free</a>
            </td>
            <td style="padding-left:10px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td style="border:1px solid #111827;border-radius:999px;">
              <a href="<%= @play_store_url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:11px 16px;color:#111827;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;">Get the app</a>
            </td></tr></table></td></tr>
          </table>
          <p style="margin:24px 0 0;">Best regards,<br><strong><%= @sender_name %></strong><br><span style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;">Sales &amp; Partnerships, Carbon Cube Kenya<br>WhatsApp: +254 727 854 903 · Call: +254 712 990 524 · info@carboncube-ke.com</span></p>
        </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="background:#f9fafb;padding:16px 32px;color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;">
          You're receiving this because we think your business would be a great fit for our marketplace. Reply STOP to opt out.
        </td></tr>
      </table>
    </td></tr>
  </table>
</body></html>
